create a EC2 instance of linux (ubuntu) on a AWS . and access it on a terminal with these two commands/
chmod 400 ~/foldername/mylinux.pem (folder name means where you download the .pem file of the instance and locate that file .
ssh -i ~/foldername/mylinux.pem ubuntu@ pubic ip .
